name crimson
category Package
revision 54512
shortdesc Crimson fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Crimson family of fonts, designed by Sebastian
longdesc Kosch. The Crimson family is for book production in the
longdesc tradition of beautiful oldstyle typefaces, inspired
longdesc particularly by the work of people like Jan Tschichold (Sabon),
longdesc Robert Slimbach (Arno, Minion), and Jonathan Hoefler (Hoefler
longdesc Text). Support for small caps and old-style numerals is still
longdesc "under construction"; these features are not supported by this
longdesc version of the package.
execute addMap crimson.map
containersize 1383508
